<title>HONG KONG: Wang On interim results up 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Wang On interim results up 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.5    vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    19.14  vs 17.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		     155.92 vs 187.64</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wang On Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 13-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 24</p>
<p>NOTE - Wang On Group provides building-related decoration and construction services.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
